        <div class="row marg30">
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Deep Cleaning Facial</h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>This facial is customized and specifically formulated to repair and rejuvenate skin. Dring this treatment skin will be cleaned, exfoliated, hydrated, and moisturized. This treatment is suitable for all skin types.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $65 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>24 Karat Gold Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>This 24 karat anti-aging treatment repairs and rejuvenate skin. Gold improves skin hydration, elasticity, and reverses oxidation damage. Gold is known as anti-inflammatory. </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $65 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
             <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Hyaluronic Acid Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>Hyaluronic Acid helps to repair damaged hatity, flikiness, redness, and general hydration. It increases skin firmness and elasticity to eliminate fine lines and wrinkles. Hyaluronic Acid is known for wond repair characteristics.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $70 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Acne Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>This treatment is designed for oily skin, hormonal imbalance, and stressed skin.It cleans pores, heals blemishes, and soothes the skin.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $75 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Sensitive Skin Facial</h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>This treatment calms conditions such as stressed skin, rosacea, and symptoms of hypersensitive skin. It dramatically reduces redness, and skin irritation. </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $75 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Ultra sound Anti-Aging Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>This treatment is used to penetrate products deep into the dermal layers to promote cellular renewal/repair, reduces inflammation and increases blood circulation.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $65 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Vitamin C Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>A potent concentration of stabilized Vitamin C with the latest high-tech formulation of pure, freeze-dried seaweed. This mask reduces fine lines, strengthens skin's elasticity, counteracts photo-aging, and restores a youthful appearance, rendering skin luminous!</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $70 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Gentlemen's Grooming Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>A complete fitness for men's skin. A deep cleansing is performed to exfoliate and prepare the skin for an application of high-tech ingredients to prevent or relieve razor burn and sensitivity.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $65 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Back Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>A facial for the back, this wonderful treatment includes exfoliation, an aromatic steam, deep pore cleansing and a pore refining mask, all followed by a light massage and a veil of moisturizer. It is a great treatment for problematic acne on the back or just to rejuvenate the skin for a special occasion.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $75 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
            
            
            <div class="neighborhood-guides" >
                <div class="container">
                    
                    <div class="row ">
                        <h2>Mini Facial </h2>
                        <div class="col-md-8 learn-more ">
                            <p>Mini Facial (30 minutes) During this treatment the skin is cleansed, gently exfoliated and hydrated using a mask. This is a great way to relieve stress and keep up with skin treatments on the go. </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <p>Price <span>  $35 </span></p>
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
			<br>
